'''Chase Wheeler''' is a [[Human|human]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] that can be found in the Thunder Falls [[Speedways|Speedway]], located in [[Lakeshore]]. He stands next to the billboard on the west side of the gate entrance. Also his [[Quests|quests]] are part of the Kart Driver Quest Series, he will not offer you any quests until you have completed all previous quests in the series.

==Quests==
*Kart Driver: Making Amends
*Kart Driver: High Speed Chase
*Kart Driver: Sweetwater Sasparilla Sponsorship
